{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n山項靚景餐廳!邪惡鹹蛋黃龍蝦伊麵\n</p>\n<h2>山頂靚景港式Fusion菜餐廳</h2>\n<p>從鰂魚涌起家嘅餐飲品牌「NOOK」，最近進駐山頂凌霄閣開設旗艦概念店「NOOK@The Peak」！新店坐擁過百個座位，最吸引係一整排超開揚落地玻璃窗，飽覽一望無際維港海景，淨係個景已經值回票價！餐廳由香港設計工作室 Anti-Antics 操刀，店內不單止可以見到向勵德邨致敬嘅經典圓弧線條、竹棚與舊式店舖摺閘元素，仲設有懸掛雕刻麻雀牌嘅玩味鳥籠裝置，處處都係打卡位！</p>\n<h2>必食甜品！玉璽黑芝麻朱古力麻糬</h2>\n<p>菜式方面，主廚 Chef Ling 大玩創意，將法式烹調技巧融合香港茶餐廳與大排檔情懷，以嶄新方式呈現。包括避風塘軟殼蟹蟹肉炒飯、 鹹蛋黃龍蝦伊麵、以廣東家常菜土魷蒸肉餅為靈感的海龍王燒賣 、麻婆牛肉可樂餅等。甜品方面必試玉璽造型「御印」，以黑芝麻朱古力塑成石獅，配上包裹花生慕絲的軟糯麻糬，以及香脆花生朱古力薄脆，非常精緻特別。</p>\n<p>NOOK@The Peak<br/>\n地址：山頂山頂道128號凌霄閣二樓204至205號舖 �電話：<a>9888 7042</a><br/>\n營業時間:星期一至五上午11時30分至晚上10時;星期六、日及公眾假期上午11時至晚上10時<br/>\n官方IG：@nook.peak</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489522992376115_8583555736afbed7e528be.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489522992376115_8583555736afbed7e528be.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489523163899168_8246443476afbed800f2c9.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489523163899168_8246443476afbed800f2c9.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794895233452207_1744190646afbed81d82dd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1794895233452207_1744190646afbed81d82dd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489523535053613_5011376776afbed83ba657.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489523535053613_5011376776afbed83ba657.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489523709936052_14075077986afbed859b358.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489523709936052_14075077986afbed859b358.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489523940582538_6410244816afbed87de479.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489523940582538_6410244816afbed87de479.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489524181411956_19485768526afbed8a4405c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"478\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179489524181411956_19485768526afbed8a4405c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>(圖片來源：官方圖片)</figcaption></figure>\n<blockquote><p>在 Instagram 查看這則貼文<a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Df09_e9jcnz/?utm_source=ig_embed&amp;utm_campaign=loading\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">新假期 Weekend Weekly（@weekendweekly）分享的貼文</a></p></blockquote>\n<p>\n</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T06:09:10.700081+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":662,"images":7,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T06:00:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T06: